000\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 224px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%;text-align: center;height: 161px\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Application Begin : <b>10/07/2026</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>30/07/2026</b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Pay Exam Fees Last Date : <b>30/07/2026</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Correction Date : <b>01-02 August 2026 </b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Exam Date : <b>22 August 2026</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Exam City Details Available : <strong>13/08/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Admit Card Available : <b>18/08/2026</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Answer Key Available : <strong>04/09/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Result Declared : <b>Notified Soon</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%;height: 161px;text-align: left\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General UR : <b>2700/-</b></li>\n<li>OBC NCL / EWS <b>: 2450/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : <b>1800/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, E Challan, E Wallet, Cash Card Fee Mode Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 10px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">AIAPGET 2026</span>&nbsp;: Admission Details</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 26.4017%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Course Name</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 39.9926%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"4\"><b>AIAPGET Eligibility</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 15px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 26.4017%;height: 15px\" colspan=\"2\">AIAPGET 2026 MD/ MS/PG DIPLOMA Courses<br role=\"presentation\">in Ayurveda, Unani, Siddha &amp; Homoeopathy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 39.9926%;height: 15px\" colspan=\"4\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Degree in BAMS/ BUMS/ BSMS/ BHMS/Graded BHMS</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">All India Ayush PG Entrance Test 2026</span>&nbsp;Exam District Details</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Uttar Pradesh :</b> Prayagraj, Agra, Gorakhpur, Bareilly, Jhansi, Kanpur, Lucknow, Meerut Varanasi.</li>\n<li><b>Rajasthan :</b> Bikaner, Jaipur, Jodhpur, Sri Gangangar, Kota, Udaipur</li>\n<li><b>Maharashtra :</b> Nagpur, Nashik, Pune, Latur, Solapur.</li>\n<li><b>New Delhi :</b> Delhi/ NCR</li>\n<li>Other Various State Huge Center District Are Available for Details Must Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full AIAPGET 2026 Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.5577%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 66.3943%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Download Answer Key</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"te