\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"NTA AIAPGET Notification 2026\" href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s388a839f2f6f1427879fc33ee4acf4f66/uploads/2026/07/20260710583088132.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 34.8366%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Download Brochure</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 31.5577%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"NTA AIAPGET Information Bulletin 2026\" href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s388a839f2f6f1427879fc33ee4acf4f66/uploads/2026/07/20260710422047595.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px;width: 34.8366%\" colspan=\"4\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 31.5577%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.8366%;text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"4\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 31.5577%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"NTA AIAPGET Official Website\" href=\"https://exams.nta.nic.in/aiapget/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>NTA AIAPGET Official Website</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute;left: 931px;top: 1322.42px\">\n<div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div>\n\n<!-- Internal_header_07-11-2024 -->\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">1. NTA AIAPGET Admissions Online Form Start Date?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong>10 July 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>2. NTA AIAPGET Admissions Exam Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Examination will be conducted in<strong> 22/08/2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>3. Where can I find the syllabus for the NTA AIAPGET Admissions Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme for the NTA AIAPGET Admissions Examination are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>4. NTA AIAPGET 2026 Admissions Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>5. NTA AIAPGET 2026 Online Form Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>30 July 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Pay application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong>30 July&nbsp;2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>7. How can I apply for NTA AIAPGET Admissions Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_26356\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-26356\" style=\"width: 1590px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-26356\" title=\"NTA AIAPGET Admissions 2026\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/NTA-AIAPGET.jpeg\" alt=\"NTA AIAPGET\" width=\"1600\" height=\"917\"